**Additional observations**
- HAL_PKA_ECDSASign / HAL_PKA_ECDSAVerif works correctly for secp256r1 on the same target.
- HAL_PKA_PointCheck reports IsOnCurve=0 even for the known base point G, and HAL_PKA_ECCMulEx returns OPERR,
  which may indicate broader ECC mode RAM layout mismatch on this target.

**Request**
Please confirm whether the stm32h7rsxx HAL PKA ECC mode RAM layouts are correct for STM32H7S3 series.
If not, please provide corrected offsets / updated HAL driver so ECC point multiplication (key generation/ECDH)
can be hardware-accelerated on STM32H7S3 devices.

